# Olduum's edges: a level 75 Warrior in Aydeewa Subterrane with an Olduum Ring and a Pickaxe, Olduum accepted (a GM).
# Accepted, the ring held: a Pickaxe: nil. Completed (a GM), Reissue 0, the ring held: a Pickaxe: nil. No statement
# takes an item, so the Wait arms run on a second char: bob, Olduum completed, no ring, Reissue 1 and Wait an hour ahead
# (GMs: the harness clock starts at 1800000000): Dkhaaya: Wait: 7 (no parameter); finished with option 99: Wait:
# nothing; an Excavation Site: Wait ahead: nil.
lists AydeewaSubterrane/Excavation_Site/onTrade AhtUrhganWhitegate/Dkhaaya/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/7
char zone=AydeewaSubterrane pos=392,0.984,349.642 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=-71.7,0,-5.842 job=WAR lvl=75
item OlduumRing
item Pickaxe
quest AhtUrhgan.Olduum accepted
bob: item Pickaxe
bob: quest AhtUrhgan.Olduum completed
bob: charvar Quest[6][2]Reissue 1
bob: charvar Quest[6][2]Wait 1800003600
login
trade Excavation_Site Pickaxe x1        # accepted, the ring held: nil
finish-if-event
quest AhtUrhgan.Olduum completed        # a GM
trade Excavation_Site Pickaxe x1        # completed, Reissue 0: nil
finish-if-event
bob: login
bob: trigger Dkhaaya                    # completed, Wait in the future: 7
bob: finish option=99                   # Wait: nothing
bob: warp 392,0.984,349.642 AydeewaSubterrane
bob: trade Excavation_Site Pickaxe x1   # Reissue 1, Wait in the future: nil
bob: finish-if-event
